    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Carroll are delighted to present this well-proportioned two-bedroom, second-floor apartment at Nicholas Court, Dundalk, Co. Louth, to the market.\n\nExtending to approximately 61 sq.m. / 657 sq.ft., the property offers well-planned accommodation comprising an entrance hall, open-plan kitchen/living/dining room, two bedrooms and a bathroom. The small balcony adds a bright and versatile environment to the kitchen/living/dining space presenting comfortable hub for day-to-day living. \n\nNicholas Court is a gated residential development with communal parking, providing residents with a secure and convenient setting within walking distance of Dundalk Town Centre. The area is well serviced by a wide range of shops, services, recreational amenities and transport links. In addition, the property is convenient to the M1 Motorway providing easy access to both Dublin & Belfast city ideal for commuters or those operating on a hybrid working basis. \n\nThe property would make an ideal purchase for a first-time buyer, downsizer or investor.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate all that this property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nSitting Room - 4.51m x 3.70m\n\n\nKitchen - 3.11m x 2.02m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.62m x 2.96m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.62m x 2.90m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.86m x 1.75m\n\n\n - \nTOTAL FLOOR AREA: 61.0 sq.m. (657 sq.ft.) approx.\n\n"
      },
